

-> @RequestBody & @ResponseBody

    @RequestBody
        Converts JSON → Java Object
        Uses Jackson

    ->    json type
            {
              "name": "Amit"
            }

    ->    for java
            @PostMapping
            public UserDTO create(@RequestBody UserDTO dto) {
                return dto;
            }


-> @ResponseBody
        Converts Java Object → JSON
        Automatically applied in @RestController


    @GetMapping
    @ResponseBody
    public UserDTO get() {
        return new UserDTO(1L, "Amit");
    }

